.venv
.venv/**
venv
venv/**
env
env/**
ENV
ENV/**
__pycache__
__pycache__/**
**/__pycache__/**
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info
*.egg-info/**
dist
build

# ─── Node.js & Frontend Artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
node_modules/**
**/node_modules/**
frontend/node_modules
frontend/node_modules/**
frontend/.next
frontend/.next/**
.next
.next/**
frontend/.vercel
frontend/.vercel/**
frontend/out
frontend/out/**
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── Environment & Secret Files ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!backend/.env.example

